		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Oft mistaken for undead, this golem is a haphazard jumble of femurs, skulls, ribcages, and skeletal parts.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 26, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 slam +4 (2d6) and 1 bone prison (near), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Bone Prison</strong>. Throw pile of bones at target, which assemble into a bone cage. DEX 15+ or imprisoned, STR 15+ on turn to break free.</p><p></p><p><strong>Golem</strong>. Immune to damage from non-magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
